00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:48.300
So I was wondering like,
what was your intention,

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:49.940
other than the fact that
you're an amazing singer?

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:50.850
- Oh, thank you so much.

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:52.680
Okay, so here's what really happened.

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:54.670
So I had gone through
this little period of time

00:00:54.670 --> 00:00:56.829
where I was sort of not doing
what I loved to do anymore.

00:00:56.829 --> 00:00:59.100
I just stopped doing all
the things I loved to do.

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:02.320
And I woke up one day and
decided, you know what?

00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:04.340
I am not as happy as I could be.

00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:06.410
So I'm gonna say yes to
everything that I love.

00:01:06.410 --> 00:01:07.980
So every day I would say yes to,

00:01:07.980 --> 00:01:09.780
someone would call and say
"Do you wanna do this?"

00:01:09.780 --> 00:01:10.740
And I'd be like, "No."

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:11.840
And then they'd be like,
"Do you wanna do that?"

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:12.673
I'm like, "Yes!"

00:01:12.673 --> 00:01:15.360
Like whatever was a hell
yes in my body I was doing

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:18.560
so a girlfriend of mine asked
me to host a music show.

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:19.750
She said, "Would you
host this thing with me?"

00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:21.300
And I was like... No,
first she asked me to sing.

00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:22.140
I said yes.

00:01:22.140 --> 00:01:22.973
Then she asked me to host it.

00:01:22.973 --> 00:01:23.806
I said, yes.

00:01:23.806 --> 00:01:25.490
And then she said, "I hope you're not mad

00:01:25.490 --> 00:01:27.150
but I got you an audition for The Voice."

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:28.740
And I was like, "Oh no, I can't, I can't."

00:01:28.740 --> 00:01:30.110
And I was like, I have to say yes

00:01:30.110 --> 00:01:31.443
because I love singing, you know?

00:01:31.443 --> 00:01:32.570
It's my joy.

00:01:32.570 --> 00:01:34.960
And I went on and made it on Team Blake.

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:37.406
- [Kelly] Your rasp is so cool.

00:01:37.406 --> 00:01:38.480
(audience cheers)

00:01:38.480 --> 00:01:39.790
