said, you should do voiceover.

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:19.870
And I was like, oh, I don't know.

00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:20.703
You know, I don't do that.

00:02:20.703 --> 00:02:21.536
But I did.

00:02:21.536 --> 00:02:22.860
I went on my first audition for cartoon

00:02:22.860 --> 00:02:26.037
and it was Tommy Pickles
on Rugrats was my first.

00:02:26.037 --> 00:02:27.409
(audience cheers)

00:02:27.409 --> 00:02:28.242
- That's your first.

00:02:28.242 --> 00:02:29.780
