00:02:29.780 --> 00:02:31.680
- No, I just love that
that was your first,

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:33.667
I'm like "Wow, it worked out."

00:02:33.667 --> 00:02:36.270
I know that you've both
actually done animation work.

00:02:36.270 --> 00:02:37.760
So isn't it, I love doing that.

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:39.990
I think it's fun to go and
do like voiceover stuff.

00:02:39.990 --> 00:02:40.823
